        <input name="weight" id="weight" type="number" value="220" style="border:1.5px solid #dde8e3;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:1.8rem;color:#0D3B27;width:160px;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-top:8px;"><br>
        <input name="weight_slider" id="weightSlider" type="range" min="100" max="600" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px;accent-color:#0D3B27;">
        <div style="display:inline-block;padding:18px 24px;border-radius:16px;margin-top:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef7f3,#e4f2ec);color:#0D3B27;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;">
          You could easily lose:
          <div style="font-size:3.2rem;font-weight:700;color:#0D3B27;line-height:1;margin-top:4px;">
