<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-16" id="faqs">
  <h2 class="text-6xl text-center font-normal tracking-tight" style="color:#0D3B27;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;">We've got you.</h2>
  <p class="text-lg text-center py-4" style="color:#1A5C3A;">You have questions, we have answers.</p>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How does Malmo work?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>Malmo allows you to get prescription weight loss medications such as semaglutide &amp; tirzepatide from the comfort of your home. Your pricing is one simple monthly price and includes medication, supplies, doctor review and shipping. Once approved, our pharmacies will ship your medication within 2 business days.<br><br>*If for any reason your prescription is not approved, you will receive a full refund.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How do I know this is safe?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>All doctors are vetted and licensed in your state. Pharmacies are US-based 503A compounding pharmacies. We maintain LegitScript certification — the telemedicine industry's most recognized compliance authority.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How does the signup process work?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><ol style="padding-left:20px;margin-top:8px;"><li style="margin-bottom:6px;">Complete the health qualifier (about 5 minutes).</li><li style="margin-bottom:6px;">Select your preferred prescription.</li><li style="margin-bottom:6px;">Pay for the first month.*</li><li style="margin-bottom:6px;">Complete medical intake form in your patient portal.</li><li style="margin-bottom:6px;">Provider reviews within 24 hrs (often less than 5 hrs).</li><li style="margin-bottom:6px;">If approved, pharmacy ships via 1-day FedEx or UPS.</li></ol><p style="margin-top:10px;">*Full refund if not approved.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What states are eligible?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>Malmo currently provides services to all 50 US states.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How does the pricing work?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>Semaglutide: $297/month. Tirzepatide: $497/month. Oral sublingual: $249/month. All pricing includes medication, doctor visits, 1-day FedEx or UPS shipping, and all supplies. No hidden fees or membership charges.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What if I need to cancel?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>No contracts. Cancel anytime by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@malmohealth.com" style="color:#C9A96E;">hello@malmohealth.com</a> or calling <a href="tel:+13433035101" style="color:#C9A96E;">+1-343-303-5101</a>. We offer a patient satisfaction guarantee.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Is the medication real semaglutide &amp; tirzepatide?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>Yes — real prescription-grade compounds prepared by licensed US pharmacies. The same active ingredients people are getting real results with all over social media.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Do you offer non-injectable options?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>Yes! Oral sublingual Semaglutide and Tirzepatide. Place one tablet under your tongue and let it dissolve for 30 seconds. Studies show this is a great alternative to injections.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How is it shipped?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>Prescriptions received before 2pm CT ship same-day via next-day UPS, temperature-controlled. Weekend orders ship Monday. Fully insured with tracking.<br><br>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@malmohealth.com" style="color:#C9A96E;">hello@malmohealth.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+13433035101" style="color:#C9A96E;">+1-343-303-5101</a>.</p></div></div>
    <div style="border:1px solid #e2ece7;border-radius:14px;" class="faq-item"><button class="w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-lg font-medium focus:outline-none" style="color:#0D3B27;" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How much weight will I lose?<span style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#C9A96E;">+</span></button><div class="hidden px-6 pb-6" style="color:#38312c;"><p>On average, patients lose 1.5% of body weight per week. Over 12 weeks, up to 10% — equivalent to 10–20 lbs for a 200-lb person. Results depend on adherence to diet and exercise.</p></div></div>
